WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Crouching light kick begins the corner light confirm.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.550
Standing light kick completes the three-light chain.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.550
OD Kikoken connects before back medium punch.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.550
The Rush-cancelled back heavy punch carries the juggle into stance.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.050
Serenity Stream heavy kick launches Juri.

6
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:04.550
The first airborne down-medium-kick stomp connects.

7
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:04.950
A delayed second stomp maintains the juggle.

8
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.050
Jumping heavy punch and its follow-up finish the airborne sequence.

9
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.250
Chun-Li spends all three Super stocks on Soten Ranka.

10
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.200
Juri recovers after the full Level 3 cinematic.
